### List all Detil Verifikasi
GET {{baseUrl}}/detil-verifikasi
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Get spesifik Detil Verifikasi
GET {{baseUrl}}/detil-verifikasi/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Update Detil Verifikasi
PUT {{baseUrl}}/detil-verifikasi/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
"DetailPermintaan": true,
"RincianPersediaan": true,
"SPK": true,
"HargaPersediaan": true,
"SuratTugasKAP": true
}